data: {"id": "9a4c49d649c34758-thinking-parallel_evidence-987", "run_id": "9a4c49d649c34758", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n### 1. Kubernetes Pod 状态与 Events\n- **Pod**: `workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v` 在 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间，调度到 `node2` (10.2.0.50)\n- **状态**: `Pending`，Reason: `ContainerCreating`\n- **关键事件**:\n  - `multus` 报告 `Warning NoNetworkFound`：无法找到网络附加定义 `unavailable-network`（namespace: `aiops-case-05`）\n  - `kubelet` 报告 `Warning FailedCreatePodSandBox`：因 multus 缺失网络配置导致 sandbox 创建失败\n  - 事件持续约 27 分钟，重复出现\n- **Pod Spec 注解**: `k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/networks: unavailable-network` — 明确引用了不存在的网络定义\n\n### 2. Pod YAML 分析\n-", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788429647872, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

