`）明确指示 `network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cni.cncf.io \"unavailable-network\" not found`，且该错误在观察窗口内多次发生。\n2.  **故障传递**：Kubelet 事件日志（`FailedCreatePodSandBox`）确认 Multus 插件在初始化网络时因找不到上述定义而抛出 RPC 错误，这直接导致了 Pod Sandbox 的创建失败。\n3.  **状态印证**：Pod 实体状态为 `ContainerCreating`，与上述配置错误导致的容器无法启动现象一致。\n\n现有证据足以支撑上述结论，无需更多数据即可确认此异常。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.3m\n├─ 问题定位: 24.1s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 40.2s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v: 40.2s (Evidence 34.8s, RCA 5.2s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 11.9s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v**: pod-volume-mount-failed, pod-sandbox-create-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 76.263, "metrics": {"run_id": "9a4c49d649c34758", "mttr": {"value": "1.3m", "seconds": 76.26691818237305, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-sandbox-create-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0